<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:afa1dbcd-0adf-417c-8386-07289156dc6f" title="Serving the Web" data-linktype="external">Serving the Web:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:afa1dbcd-0adf-417c-8386-07289156dc6f" title="Stored Procedure Wizard in Visual Basic Boosts Productivity" data-linktype="external">Stored Procedure Wizard in Visual Basic Boosts Productivity</a></p>
<p>Ken Spencer</p>
<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:f3b9a3a2-159b-4583-902c-ca8eaad05e87" title="Cutting Edge" data-linktype="external">Cutting Edge:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:f3b9a3a2-159b-4583-902c-ca8eaad05e87" title="Binary Behaviors in Internet Explorer 5.5" data-linktype="external">Binary Behaviors in Internet Explorer 5.5</a></p>
<p>Dino Esposito</p>
<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:9a6afcf9-7ed0-4453-b7b1-3dc67c425fae" title="Visual Programmer" data-linktype="external">Visual Programmer:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:9a6afcf9-7ed0-4453-b7b1-3dc67c425fae" title="Advanced ASP.NET Server-side Controls" data-linktype="external">Advanced ASP.NET Server-side Controls</a></p>
